{"type":"message","id":"fb978198","parentId":"3319914c","timestamp":"2026-03-11T13:34:27.675Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-03-11 22:34 GMT+9] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/1). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: Review OpenClaw personalization settings and whether the user's OpenClaw configuration appears publicly exposed. Work read-only. Check relevant local config/docs/status. Summarize: (1) personalization settings the user should consider, (2) whether their OpenClaw setup/config is public/exposed, with evidence and caveats. Keep concise but technically solid."}],"timestamp":1773236067672}}
