tabase consistency afterward.\\n- **Action:** Choose your recovery path (offline OS repair OR restore + DBA validation) and inform Justin.\\n\\n**4. Recovery Path Confirmation**\\n- **From:** Justin Gross (Microsoft)\\n- **The Situation:** Same as above - Justin needs to know which recovery option you want to proceed with so they can start the support process.\\n- **Action:** Reply to Justin with your decision.\\n\\n**5. DBA Involvement for Restore Option**\\n- **From:** Justin Gross (Microsoft)\\n- **The Situation:** If you choose to restore from backup, you'll need to get the Oracle DBA involved to validate database consistency after recove…\",\"sessionId\":\"f659a398-d02c-4525-ac08-9cbdc552ca24\",\"sessionKey\":\"agent:main:cron:9fbab8e2-08fa-4e76-aa00-93296c5dfd89:run:f659a398-d02c-4525-ac08-9cbdc552ca24\",\"runAtMs\":1771714801082,\"durationMs\":125860,\"nextRunAtMs\":1771801200000,\"model\":\"glm-4.7\",\"provider\":\"zai\",\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":6879,\"output_tokens\":1846,\"total_tokens\":12228}}\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/cron/runs/9fbab8e2-08fa-4e76-aa00-93296c5dfd89.jsonl:7:{\"ts\":1771801242634,\"jobId\":\"9fbab8e2-08fa-4e76-aa00-93296c5dfd89\",\"action\":\"finished\",\"status\":\"error\",\"error\":\"cron announce delivery failed\",\"summary\":\"🌌 **Good morning, Sam! Here's your Notion briefing from yesterday morning to today:**\\n\\n---\\n\\n**📅 Period:** Feb 22, 07:00 → Feb 23, 07:00\\n\\n---\\n\\n**⚡ Action Required:**\\n\\n1. **SAP EP Server Incident Update Request** — *Jay.Choi* is asking for a status update on the SAP EP server outage situation. The incident involved server boot failure, with a Microsoft case opened and VM backup recovery planned.\\n\\n---\\n\\n**👀 For Your Awareness (FYI):**\\n\\n2. **SAP EP Service Restored** — *Sam.Yeo* reported that the SAP EP service has been fully restored. Server recovery completed at 8:49 AM, and final service check finished at 11:25 AM yesterday.\\n\\n3. **Teams Meetings Numeric Passcodes** — *Sabareeswaran.R* added Korea UAT test accounts to the pilot group for simplified numeric passcodes (global initiative for user experience improvement). He's requesting your review and approval as soon as possible — other regions are also requesting this urgently.\\n\\n4. **Azure Backup Daily Report** — *Shinwoo.Kim* sent the daily backup compliance report. One daily backup failure was recorded on Feb 21, 2026.\\n\\n5. **SAP EP Incident Follow-up** — *Jay.Choi* replied \\\"Good\\\" to the service restoration notification.\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Summary:** Main focus is responding to Jay.Choi's update request on the SAP EP incident and reviewing/approving the Teams passcodes pilot for Korea. Everything else is informational.\\n\\nHave a great day, Sam! 🚀\",\"sessionId\":\"b027a0f7-dacf-434b-9470-80f9d0c7c2ab\",\"sessionKey\":\"agent:main:cron:9fbab8e2-08fa-4e76-aa00-93296c5dfd89:run:b027a0f7-dacf-434b-9470-80f9d0c7c2ab\",\"runAtMs\":1771801202384,\"durationMs\":40245,\"nextRunAtMs\":1771887600000,\"model\":\"glm-4.7\",\"provider\":\"zai\",\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":4559,\"output_tokens\":892,\"total_tokens\":10146}}\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/cron/runs/9fbab8e2-08fa-4e76-aa00-93296c5dfd89.jsonl:8:{\"ts\":1771881704723,\"jobId\":\"9fbab8e2-08fa-4e76-aa00-93296c5dfd89\",\"action\":\"finished\",\"status\":\"ok\",\"summary\":\"Good morning, Sam! 🌌\\n\\nHere's your Notion daily briefing covering **Feb 22, 07:00 - Feb 23, 07:00**:\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🔴 Action Required\\n\\n**1. SAP EP Server Incident Update**\\n- **From:** Jay.Choi\\n- **What:** Jay is requesting an update on the SAP EP server boot failure incident. You had notified about the MS case being opened and VM backup recovery being planned.\\n- **Status:** **Needs your response**\\n\\n## ⚠️ Approval Needed\\n\\n**2. Teams Meetings - Simplified Numeric Passcodes**\\n- **From:** Sabareeswaran.R (Global)\\n- **What:** Following your request, Korea UAT test accounts have been added to the global pilot group for simplified numeric passcodes i