y files (Feb 16-23)\\n- **Key Insights Captured:** System architecture, automation configs, security issues, user preferences, technical workarounds\\n\\nThe long-term memory is now current and curated for future sessions.\",\"delivered\":true,\"deliveryStatus\":\"delivered\",\"sessionId\":\"1372c5a6-8669-4f55-abab-42c8baef5b6d\",\"sessionKey\":\"agent:main:cron:07b6a467-2277-4376-8c4c-b8ae1a7ac74f:run:1372c5a6-8669-4f55-abab-42c8baef5b6d\",\"runAtMs\":1771882746873,\"durationMs\":58234,\"nextRunAtMs\":1772373600000,\"model\":\"glm-4.7\",\"provider\":\"zai\",\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":12927,\"output_tokens\":4269,\"total_tokens\":25140}}\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/cron/runs/9fbab8e2-08fa-4e76-aa00-93296c5dfd89.jsonl:5:{\"ts\":1771628454538,\"jobId\":\"9fbab8e2-08fa-4e76-aa00-93296c5dfd89\",\"action\":\"finished\",\"status\":\"ok\",\"summary\":\"🌌 **Good morning Sam! Here's your Notion daily briefing for Feb 20-21:**\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📌 Quick Actions (Priority)\\n\\n🔴 **Urgent:**\\n- **RITM19178967** - Software request cancelled (Chloe didn't respond to 3 approval notices) - need to follow up or resubmit\\n- **Windows Admin Center Upgrade** - Patch to 2.6.4+ for CVE-2026-26119 vulnerability\\n- **VP Approved Budget** - Share with Muk.Kim for AI project bidding\\n\\n🟡 **Follow Up:**\\n- **Tax invoice** received (Feb 20, 22.5M + 2.25M VAT) - confirm status\\n- **cdn.builder.io** - Review and approve URL allowance\\n- **AI Project** - Share RFP, timeline, and vendor pool with Muk.Kim\\n\\n---\\n\\n## ✅ Completed\\n\\n**RITM18928808** - ABI contractor account access request completed\\n**RITM19297325** - VPN issue resolved (working since 17:10)\\n\\n**Infrastructure:**\\n- China BCC team SAP access restored (IDC hardware issue resolved)\\n- Azure backup report (Feb 13-19): All daily & weekly backups successful\\n\\n**Upcoming:**\\n- Windows 11 installation test on RPA PC scheduled for Monday, Feb 23\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🛡️ Security & Compliance\\n\\n**Flexera Baseline Update:**\